      "statement": "The structural fix for this class of complaint - migrating cbo-wire-bff from PPH v1 to v2 (epic CBO-4471) - is unscheduled, sized at 34 points, blocked on CES account-filter mapping story CBO-4473, and was not yet in PI 26.4 or PI 27.1 draft planning as of the 2026-10-05 export; a client-facing gpi status capability is also unbuilt, tracked only as spike CBO-4480 (status To Do).",
